  description: Tripo-generated exhibits. The five characters came from muse-infinity,
    where they were generated with Tripo from AI-synthesised four-view turnaround
    sheets and bundled as ~2M-triangle GLBs. They are decimated to ~60k here by Tools/tripo/decimate.mjs.
  radius: 3.6
  arcDegrees: 112
  defaultTargetHeight: 1.7
  pedestalHeight: 0.75
  entries:
  - id: monet
    displayName: Claude Monet
    caption: "Impressionist painter, 1840\u20131926\nAI interpretation \xB7 public-domain
      self-portrait"
    model: {fileID: 4763709778603971394, guid: 8a77616056ce47c4a9a157e6a9ba2541, type: 3}
    tripoModelVersion: 
    tripoTaskType: multiview_to_model (inferred from the four-view inputs)
    tripoTaskId: 
    sourceInputs: 'Generated with Tripo from assets/generated/turnarounds/views/monet/
      (front, left, back, right). The task id, model version and date were not recorded
      upstream. Identity reference: public-domain self-portrait.'
    rights: AI interpretation, not an authentic likeness. Derived from a documented
      public-domain portrait; unseen angles, costume and geometry are synthesis.
      See muse-infinity/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
    generatedOn: 
    targetHeight: 0
    yawOffset: 0
